<title>USA: U.S. cocoa bean, product imports - Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. cocoa bean, product imports - Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce report of</p>
<p>cocoa bean and cocoa product imports, in tonnes:</p>
<p>		     Sept96    Aug96   Sept95</p>
<p> Cocoa Beans-X   21,416   17,859   21,263</p>
<p>Cocoa Paste --</p>
<p> - Not Defatted   1,358    1,715    1,546</p>
<p> - Defatted	 1,855    3,776    2,907</p>
<p> Cocoa Butter-Y   4,979    6,640    5,733</p>
<p> Cocoa Powder     5,629    7,397    5,952</p>
<p>Note-Cocoa products contain no sugar or milk products.</p>
<p>X-Whole or broken, raw or roasted. Y-Includes fat and oil.</p>
</text>
